  "name": "Dev Balaclava Fix",
  "slug": "dev-balaclava-fix",
  "teaser": "Just makes you actually invincible while wearing the Dev Balaclava. Meant for mod developers. Immune to explosions, border snipers, BTR running you over, etc",
